4. Components that accompany built artifacts
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Binaries published in this project's GitHub Releases include a MANIFEST.txt
recording the exact kernel source URL, the OpenHarmony branch, the source
commit, the toolchain used and the build parameters.  The corresponding
source is available from the same repository, at the source tag named in the
release notes, as GPL-2.0 section 3 requires.

Toolchain binaries are NOT redistributed inside boot images or artifacts.
They are downloaded at build time by CI, and their own licences apply to them
(see THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md).
